#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -u

cat >&2 <<'REFUSAL_EOF'
[pre-commit] REFUSED — this is the ops deploy checkout, not a place to commit.

It is a one-way mirror of origin/main. The only writes allowed here are git fetch
and git pull --ff-only. Commit in a workstation checkout and deploy from origin/main.

Already have work here? Do not discard it. Preserve it with git format-patch,
apply it in a workstation checkout with git am, then realign by ff-only pull.
REFUSAL_EOF
exit 1
